  "micro_rule": "Preserve a 10-20 minute minimum useful dose when appropriate. Do not compensate for lost volume by increasing intensity.",
  "progression_rule": "Progress one variable per exposure: continuous duration, total quality minutes, repetitions, pace, or recovery. Typical volume increase 5-10% when prior exposure is symptom-free and within target RPE.",
